							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
									<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-bg-subtle border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-status-emerald shrink-0">
										<svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
											<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
										</svg>
									</div>
									<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text tracking-tight">anode</h3>
									<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-status-emerald/10 border border-status-emerald/30 font-mono text-[11px] text-status-emerald font-medium">{BLOG_SERIES.anode.badge}</span>
								</div>
								
								<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
									<a
										class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-bg-subtle border border-border text-text-muted hover:text-text hover:border-border-hover transition-colors font-mono text-xs no-underline"
										href="https://anode.abhiudayg.dev"
										target="_blank"
										rel="noopener noreferrer"
										aria-label="Visit Anode website"
									>
										<span>anode.abhiudayg.dev</span>
										<span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span>
									</a>
									<a
										class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-bg-subtle border border-border text-text-muted hover:text-text hover:border-border-hover transition-colors font-mono text-xs no-underline"
										href="https://github.com/abhiudayg/anode"
										target="_blank"
										rel="noopener noreferrer"
										aria-label="View anode on GitHub"
									>
										<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
											<path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/>
										</svg>
										<span>GitHub</span>
										<span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span>
									</a>
								</div>
							</div>
							<p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
								The Docker Compose &amp; Kubernetes alternative for Go backends. Deploys unmodified Go to any Linux VPS without Dockerfiles, container daemons, or YAML drift via Go SSA Variable Type Analysis.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Telemetry metrics -->
						<div class="bg-code-bg border border-border rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-xs space-y-1.5 text-text-dim">
							<div class="flex justify-between">
								<span>Cold boot:</span>
								<span class="text-status-emerald font-medium">~35ms (17x faster than Docker)</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex justify-between">
								<span>Daemon RSS overhead:</span>
								<span class="text-text font-medium">0 daemons (Docker runtime uses ~100MB)</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex justify-between">
								<span>Supervisor &amp; Proxy:</span>
								<span class="text-text font-medium">systemd + cgroups v2 + Caddy</span>
							</div>
