							<span class="tag-pill">Go 1.27</span>
							<span class="tag-pill">Go SSA</span>
							<span class="tag-pill">systemd</span>
							<span class="tag-pill">cgroups v2</span>
							<a class="ml-auto text-text-dim hover:text-text no-underline flex items-center gap-1" href="/blog/why-we-ditched-docker-for-go-backends/">
								<span>Read dispatch</span>
								<span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>

